          <div purpose="logo-tile"><img purpose="logo-vast" alt="VAST logo" src="/images/logos/logo-vast-111x16@2x.png"></div>
          <div purpose="logo-tile"><img purpose="logo-northwood" alt="Northwood logo" src="/images/logos/logo-northwood-134x12@2x.png"></div>
          <div purpose="logo-tile"><img purpose="logo-nvidia" alt="NVIDIA logo" src="/images/logos/logo-nvidia-color-161x32@2x.png"></div>
          <div purpose="logo-tile"><img purpose="logo-sopra-steria" alt="Sopra Steria logo" src="/images/logos/logo-sopra-steria-134x18@2x.png"></div>
          <div purpose="logo-tile"><img purpose="logo-leon-software" alt="Leon Software logo" src="/images/logos/logo-leon-software-91x30@2x.png"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div purpose="feature-rows">
        <div purpose="feature-with-image" class="reverse">
          <div purpose="feature-image">
            <img alt="Vulnerabilities in Fleet, ranked by severity and probability of exploit" src="/images/aviation-vulnerability-detection-504x378@2x.png">
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-text">
            <h3>Stop waiting for Intune and Jamf to patch</h3>
            <p>Fleet keeps a live connection to every Mac and PC, so you can see and patch what’s actually on a device right now, not what it reported hours ago.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-with-image">
          <div purpose="feature-image">
            <img alt="A shared iPad with a sign-in screen for each shift, next to an iPad locked to a check-in app" src="/images/aviation-shared-devices-504x378@2x.png">
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-text">
            <h3>Shared devices that work for every shift</h3>
            <p>Share iPads and Android devices between crews and station staff, with each person's data kept separate. Or lock a device to a single app for gate check-in and kiosks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div purpose="trust-cards">
          <div purpose="trust-card">
            <img alt="SOC 2 audited" src="/images/aviation-soc-2-audited-64x64@2x.png">
            <div purpose="trust-card-content">
              <div purpose="trust-card-text">
                <h5>ISO 27001 certified, SOC 2 Type II audited</h5>
                <p>Independent audits that help you meet NIS2 supply chain requirements and pass your security and procurement review.</p>
              </div>
              <animated-arrow-button href="https://trust.fleetdm.com" target="_blank">Visit trust center</animated-arrow-button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div purpose="trust-card">
            <img alt="GDPR" src="/images/aviation-gdpr-64x64@2x.png">
            <div purpose="trust-card-content">
              <div purpose="trust-card-text">
                <h5>Hosted or self-hosted</h5>
                <p>Unlike other solutions, we can host Fleet for you (in your region) or you can deploy it yourself. Get the same features either way.</p>
              </div>
              <animated-arrow-button href="/europe">Fleet for Europe</animated-arrow-button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div purpose="feature-with-image" class="reverse">
          <div purpose="feature-image">
            <img alt="A Mac Studio, an AMD Ryzen AI Halo, and an NVIDIA DGX Spark" src="/images/aviation-desk-side-ai-504x378@2x.png">
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-text">
            <h3>Be ready for desk-side AI</h3>
            <p>AI assistants are moving onto always-on Mac Studios, NVIDIA DGX machines, and AMD AI PCs. Make sure your device management can see and manage all three before they arrive.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-with-image">
          <div purpose="feature-image">
            <img alt="The prompt employees see when their Mac migrates to Fleet" src="/images/aviation-mdm-migration-504x378@2x.png">
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-text">
            <h3>No reimaging, no downtime</h3>
            <p>Move devices from your current MDM in place, without wiping them. Employees keep working.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-with-image" class="reverse">
          <div purpose="feature-image">
            <img alt="Fleet connected to Mac, iPhone, iPad, Windows, Linux, and Android devices" src="/images/aviation-one-console-504x378@2x.png">
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-text">
            <h3>One console instead of one per platform</h3>
            <p>Manage Mac, iPhone, iPad, Windows, Linux, and Android from one place. Explore Fleet for <a href="/apple">Apple</a>, <a href="/windows">Windows</a>, and <a href="/linux">Linux</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div purpose="workshop-banner">
          <div purpose="banner-image">
            <img alt="Fleet workshop illustration with Apple, Windows, Linux, and Android" src="/images/aviation-workshop-365x223@2x.png">
          </div>
          <div purpose="banner-text">
            <div purpose="trust-card-text">
              <h5>Get your team AI certified</h5>
